(7301383, 1138914, 60173, '<td valign="top">Phew, I thought for sure that your title was going to be "We resolve to stop licking where we shouldn''t."<br/> <br/>Creative idea, and well presented. There''s some issues that resulted from cloning something out of the background, but I didn''t immediately notice them. The more noticeable ones are behind the pup, but there''s also some residuals left to the right of your neck. Chairrail molding perhaps? Though, there''s a little something extra on the pup''s side.</td>', 'Phew, I thought for sure that your title was going to be "We resolve to stop licking where we shouldn''t." Creative idea, and well presented. There''s some issues that resulted from cloning something out of the background, but I didn''t immediately notice them. The more noticeable ones are behind the pup, but there''s also some residuals left to the right of your neck. Chairrail molding perhaps? Though, there''s a little something extra on the pup''s side.', '2015-01-12 12:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
