(7305386, 1138914, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such a fabulous portrait. The light, the tones, the concept, and the exressions. Just terrific. The title just ties it all together perfectly :)</td>', 'Such a fabulous portrait. The light, the tones, the concept, and the exressions. Just terrific. The title just ties it all together perfectly :)', '2015-01-21 21:13:01.000000', NULL, 0),
