(7349596, 1138914, 86447, '<td valign="top">This cracks me up every time I''ve come back to look at it, Mark.<br/> <br/>I''ve done it several times.<br/> <br/>I''ve only just now realized that I''ve never commented on it.  *blush*<br/> <br/>I''m ashamed.<br/> <br/>But, not as ashamed as if I''d had to wear the Cone of Shame.<br/> <br/>Kudos to you.  :D<br/></td>', 'This cracks me up every time I''ve come back to look at it, Mark. I''ve done it several times. I''ve only just now realized that I''ve never commented on it.  *blush* I''m ashamed. But, not as ashamed as if I''d had to wear the Cone of Shame. Kudos to you.  :D', '2015-05-09 19:54:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7382029, 1138852, 30861, '<td valign="top">Also the rock offshore to the left helps ground the composition: WITH it, it''s not "centered" perceptually, WITHOUT it it would be too centered.</td>', 'Also the rock offshore to the left helps ground the composition: WITH it, it''s not "centered" perceptually, WITHOUT it it would be too centered.', '2015-07-05 00:59:09.000000', NULL, 0),
